Launcher regression check (2026-09-16)

- Reproduced the failure after the branding edit: the launcher had LF-only line endings,
  so Windows cmd.exe misparsed quoted paths and reported scripts\\.., streamlit_app.py,
  and http: as commands.
- Converted scripts/start_streamlit.bat to UTF-8 CRLF and added a repository attribute
  enforcing CRLF for future Windows checkouts.
